  "question": {
    "text": "Let $a, b, c$ be any real numbers. Suppose that there are real numbers $x, y, z$ not all zero such that $x=$ $c y+b z, y=a z+c x$ and $z=b x+a y$. Then $a^2+b^2+c^2+2 a b c$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
