  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The system of equations $x-c y-b z=0, c x-y+a z=0$ and $b x+a y-z=0$ have non-trivial solution if $\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & -c & -b \\\\ c & -1 & a \\\\ b & a & -1\\end{array}\\right|=0 \\Rightarrow 1\\left(1-a^2\\right)+c(-c-a b)-b(c a+b)=0$ $\\Rightarrow a^2+b^2+c^2+2 a b c=1$.",
    "image": null
  },
